        "original_id": "9c46f9fd-309f-5979-ab4b-378eac8e5c8a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Linda Eder, Frank Wildhorn, Steve Cuden, Leslie Bricusse, Robert Louis Stevenson\n- Works: Jekyll & Hyde, The Strange Case of Dr Jekyll and Mr Hyde\n- Roles: Lucy\n- Topics: Broadway, musical theatre, horror-drama\n\nFacts:\n- Linda Eder, born on February 3, 1961, is an American singer and actress.\n- Jekyll & Hyde is a musical horror-drama loosely based on Robert Louis Stevenson’s novella The Strange Case of Dr Jekyll and Mr Hyde.\n- Jekyll & Hyde was originally conceived for the stage by Frank Wildhorn and Steve Cuden.\n- Jekyll & Hyde features music by Frank Wildhorn, a book by Leslie Bricusse, and lyrics by Frank Wildhorn, Leslie Bricusse, and Steve Cuden.\n- Linda Eder made her Broadway debut in Jekyll & Hyde, originating the role of Lucy.\n- Linda Eder was nominated for a Drama Desk Award for her role as Lucy in Jekyll & Hyde.",
